The following is a project-author note, NOT a license clause, and has no
legal binding effect. It explains the scope of the MIT license above.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
0. 正面声明:合法取证不构成违法行为
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
本工具是面向以下场景设计的**合规取证工具**,在下列场景中**不构成
任何形式的违法行为**,这与本工具的代码授权 (MIT) 无关,而是工具
本身的性质所决定:

  (1) **个人取证** — 提取、备份、分析本人名下的微信聊天记录
      (用户对自己数据享有完全处置权,与《个人信息保护法》第13条
      "为个人或家庭目的处理个人信息"完全一致)

  (2) **企业合规审计** — 经员工书面知情同意、或依据合法有效的
      《员工手册》《IT 设备使用协议》《公司规章制度》进行企业内部
      数据合规审计 (与《个人信息保护法》第13条"取得个人同意"、
      《劳动合同法》企业用工管理权一致)

  (3) **警方取证(配合司法程序)** — 公安机关、国家安全机关、检察机关、
      司法鉴定机构在**法定职权范围内**、依据《刑事诉讼法》第54条
      "可以向有关单位和个人调取证据"、《公安机关办理刑事案件程序规定》
      进行的司法取证,使用本工具属于完全合法的司法行为

  (4) **司法鉴定机构(CNAS/CMA 认证)** — 经司法机关、律师事务所、
      当事人委托的电子数据司法鉴定

  (5) **学术研究** — 在受控样本(用户自愿提供)上的教学与研究

本工具不包含任何规避微信客户端鉴权、绕过设备锁屏、窃取他人账号、
监听他人通信的功能;它仅做"位对位复制 + 哈希校验 + 证据链记录",
全部操作均在**已经合法获得访问权的存储介质**上完成。

**Affirmative statement: lawful forensics is NOT illegal.**

This tool is designed for the following compliance-grade use cases, in
which it is **NOT illegal in any form** — this is independent of the
code-level MIT grant and stems from the very nature of the tool:

  (1) **Personal forensics** — extracting / backing up / analyzing
      WeChat chat records of one's own account (data subject rights
      under PIPL Art. 13 / GDPR Art. 6(1)(a))
  (2) **Enterprise compliance audits** — internal audits performed
      with employee written consent, or under a valid internal policy
      (PIPL Art. 13 / legitimate employer interest)
  (3) **Police forensics within judicial procedure** — public security,
      state security, procuratorate, and judicial-appraisal institutions
      exercising statutory powers under the PRC Criminal Procedure Law
      Art. 54 ("relevant units and individuals shall hand over evidence")
      and related regulations. Use of this tool in such procedure is
      a fully lawful judicial act.
  (4) **CNAS/CMA-accredited judicial appraisal** — engagements by
      courts, procuratorates, attorneys, or private parties
  (5) **Academic research** — teaching/research on voluntarily provided
      controlled samples

This tool does NOT contain any feature to bypass WeChat authentication,
circumvent device locks, hijack accounts, or intercept communications.
It only performs **bit-for-bit copy + SHA-256 hashing + chain-of-custody
record-keeping** on storage media to which the operator already has
lawful access.

